@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@adminToken = paste-admin-accessToken
@userToken = paste-user-accessToken
@categoryId = 1
@productId = 1
@skuId = 1
@addressId = 1
@orderId = 1
@paymentId = 1
@shipmentId = 1
@refundId = 1

### 1. 管理员登录，account / password 使用 .env 中的管理员账号密码
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"admin","password":"replace-with-a-strong-admin-password"}

### 2. 复制 accessToken 到 adminToken，创建分类，记下 categoryId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Electronics","parentId":null,"sortOrder":0}

### 3. 创建 SPU，初始为 DRAFT，记下 productId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":{{categoryId}},"name":"机械键盘","description":"87 键机械键盘","brand":"OrderHub","imageUrl":null}

### 4. 创建 SKU 及初始库存，记下 skuId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/{{productId}}/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skuCode":"KEYBOARD-BLACK-001","attributes":{"color":"Black","switch":"Brown"},"price":199.00,"status":"ACTIVE","initialStock":20}

### 5. 上架 SPU
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/products/{{productId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. 普通用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"alice@example.com","username":"alice","password":"Alice-password-123!","phone":"13800138000"}

### 7. 用户登录，复制 accessToken 到 userToken
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"account":"alice@example.com","password":"Alice-password-123!"}

### 8. 默认收货地址，记下 addressId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"receiverName":"Alice","phone":"13800138000","province":"上海市","city":"上海市","district":"浦东新区","detailAddress":"示例路 1 号","postalCode":"200000","isDefault":true}

### 9. 商品查询，支持 newest / oldest / name / priceAsc / priceDesc
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/products?page=1&size=20&sort=priceAsc&minPrice=100&maxPrice=500

### 10. 添加 SKU 到购物车，重复 POST 累加数量
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/cart/items
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skuId":{{skuId}},"quantity":2}

### 11. 查看购物车；修改/删除/勾选用 item.id，而非 skuId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. 下单，仅结算 selected=true；重试保持同一键，新订单换键
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Idempotency-Key: alice-checkout-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"addressId":{{addressId}},"userCouponId":null,"remark":"测试订单"}

### 13. 创建 MOCK 支付，记下 paymentId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders/{{orderId}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"method":"MOCK"}

### 14. 模拟支付成功；失败可调用 mock-fail，再创建新支付尝试
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/payments/{{paymentId}}/mock-success
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 15. 管理员确认处理
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/process
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 16. 发货，记下 shipmentId；运输中可通过 /shipments 添加其他包裹
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrier":"MOCK","trackingNumber":"TRACK-0001"}

### 17. 模拟送达，中间可先设置 IN_TRANSIT
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/shipments/{{shipmentId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"DELIVERED"}

### 18. 全部包裹送达后确认收货
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders/{{orderId}}/confirm-receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 19. 历史订单
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders?page=1&size=20&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 20. 订单状态历史
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/status-history
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 21. 当前可售、预占库存和 version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/inventory/{{skuId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 分支 A：另建未付款订单，取消释放库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"不需要了"}

### 分支 B：另建 PAID / PROCESSING 订单，申请退款，记下 refundId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/user/orders/{{orderId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"申请未发货退款"}

### 同意后 MOCK 退款立即完成，重复调用不重复归还库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/refunds/{{refundId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"审核通过"}

### Dashboard，按 UTC 自然日统计
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/dashboard/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Excel 导出，日期 YYYY-MM-DD，可省略使用最近 7 天
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/reports/export
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 审计日志
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
